<title>USA: Chicago Miniature lowers price for Valmont unit.</title>
<headline>Chicago Miniature lowers price for Valmont unit.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Miniature Lamp Inc said on Thursday it lowered by $2.7 million the final price it will pay for Valmont Industries Inc's lighting ballasts unit.</p>
<p>Chicago Miniature finalized the purchase price at $22.3 million rather than the $25 million originally announced, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>Chicago Miniature makes lamps, lamp equipment and components and related products.</p>
